      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "湿度"
    },
    "settings.illuminance.help": {
      "sourceHash": "99fb3d41f1634e9edd6c6c7540968106d44b7e01899f09cfe1fb98865347cae8",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "面板光线传感器测得的环境照度。"
    },
    "settings.illuminance.label": {
      "sourceHash": "bd754dd6ed86a26c4bdccfdd47a912232bae26b86fd38ad063f8f725bb7b8f97",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "环境光"
    },
    "settings.keep_awake.help": {
      "sourceHash": "d3b70b40884db042b1874360834630a2a5534a76840fb833374917dd2cb9ed92",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "屏幕关闭时仍保持网络和后台服务运行。"
    },
    "settings.keep_awake.label": {
      "sourceHash": "a7ec7e771773b541ddbd2cc8b80bcb7c777cfacca8b8a8b4251f37d51c30e366",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "保持面板响应"
    },
    "settings.kiosk_lock.help": {
      "sourceHash": "cb15071d31c33a73f5da36aef5a30c385125f3429136e556131067a9cdebd2a8",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "仅限超级用户权限的日常使用锁。隐藏 Android 系统栏；打开其他应用或最近任务后，约 3 秒内返回所选仪表盘。不会隐藏 Home Assistant 导航。可在此处或 Home Assistant 中解除，也可通过 adb、快速点击左上角 7 次，或利用重启后 60 秒的解锁窗口解除。"
    },
    "settings.kiosk_lock.label": {
      "sourceHash": "d8de0e2c0913e951dbe60ae09b03614c48b5b8a495c69ca0c45fa2798de27c63",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "将 Android 锁定到仪表盘（实验性）"
    },
    "settings.launcher_package.help": {
      "sourceHash": "524f589af2ebe612083fd20f1b6f487d59e929aae5a24cf9cd6bd4792e448395",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "启动器按钮调到前台的应用。留空会自动选择应用。选择面板管理（ha-paneld）还会将 ha-paneld 设为 Android 主屏幕应用并保持该设置。"
    },
    "settings.launcher_package.label": {
      "sourceHash": "f97faee7e687e14fb4356160757e11ca90cc6c89b0e2ce2d40e14a3a62ef1bbd",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "启动器应用"
    },
    "settings.log_ship_enabled.help": {
      "sourceHash": "01fd4a6f75c8d1eba5b4765db5c8eb1c9ebc1220b0639982525ab92b2f43e5d7",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "将 ha-paneld 自身的进程日志（不是完整系统日志）转发到中央接收端（仅限 LAN-only，令牌和密码会被隐去）。"
    },
    "settings.log_ship_enabled.label": {
      "sourceHash": "ee4fd7d2333c7de7c8d74fd95cfb065c2be72bd2e52dc3b58cf06c0e1d3d3634",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "传送日志"
    },
    "settings.log_ship_host.help": {
      "sourceHash": "0294f7fbe925135c5f7f310e2a92a2078b168792888dd39d6e41976875b3afaa",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "日志收集器主机；留空则不传送。此处指定的协议方案或 :port 会被采用（udp://collector、collector:1514）。"
    },
    "settings.log_ship_host.label": {
      "sourceHash": "039db9e5488a4a6ca3e58775a250f2d2183ac1156d5721fdd37c520a605c6bb3",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "接收端主机"
    },
    "settings.log_ship_port.label": {
      "sourceHash": "7bc8673ba2ab424916e4f1189b75faf4b4c9af8ef0d731852c09e6a660e77cd3",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "接收端端口"
    },
    "settings.log_ship_protocol.help": {
      "sourceHash": "8721aa729601cd5bf1612b97a578b3a1ef385564447d250f440e162c7dbf2bfb",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "默认使用 TCP，因为它能报告接收端拒绝连接或无法访问；UDP 无法报告，因此设置错误时会静默失败。端口 514 同时支持两者。"
    },
    "settings.log_ship_protocol.label": {
      "sourceHash": "cf0883343f4abef779b777c35764f86c9f1f4324e8b5490840245d02ad2f7c6f",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "协议"
    },
    "settings.manufacturer.help": {
      "sourceHash": "8bc18ea3fa4542ad27907e0ee82537e8430e18693d4465fa6021b045b19e5a6f",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "覆盖 HA 设备卡片中的制造商（留空表示使用配置方案或自动值）。"
    },
    "settings.manufacturer.label": {
      "sourceHash": "1af384c577f294d4164a7ea49f3021259e2b92802eac577722d14066b2bbd5ce",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "制造商"
    },
    "settings.model.help": {
      "sourceHash": "50dab8203d43b63ace9d3f98dc51ab87d675f41a61746e4b00fadf216b5d56ec",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "覆盖 HA 设备卡片中的型号（留空表示使用配置方案或自动值）。"
    },
    "settings.model.label": {
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239bc03c6c04fcb681950f9e72bf8fdff6be79c79841cbb10c0",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "型号"
    },
    "settings.mqtt_address_family.help": {
      "sourceHash": "fc6094bdf2f4455a719947c9c42ebded23bf17f38e19215fb5e210c8e46b2747",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "应用于 MQTT 消息代理连接和面板的 Home Assistant WebSocket 连接；普通 HTTPS 读取始终尝试所有已公布地址。自动模式会学习可用路由，并在 IPv6 与 IPv4 之间回退。优先 IPv4 仍将 IPv6 用作备用；强制 IPv4 会拒绝没有 IPv4 地址的端点。"
    },
    "settings.mqtt_address_family.label": {
      "sourceHash": "b8f2ae11be15cc7c5050bfc1331de84dd56d77dae350627d0e1fca419453de71",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "MQTT 与 Home Assistant WebSocket 地址族"
    },
    "settings.mqtt_broker.help": {
      "sourceHash": "aa8b8bb7adffa5c6d19213a7bc1fe500bf2a6d948bb57dbd7c2290f14f985600",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "留空则通过 mDNS 自动发现 HA。"
    },
    "settings.mqtt_broker.label": {
      "sourceHash": "cad88e3df28153445c8d1c488bc534a1f3e191acf3d636d9c1a5cc734c0f1675",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "消息代理 URL"
    },
    "settings.mqtt_password.help": {
      "sourceHash": "fa026b3e7e1e7b868ee6d7e1cc9a9bca0fb6934fce229eb36b7a494a8f41e34f",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "保存时留空可保留当前密码。"
    },
    "settings.mqtt_password.label": {
      "sourceHash": "e7cf3ef4f17c3999a94f2c6f612e8a888e5b1026878e4e19398b23bd38ec221a",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "密码"
    },
    "settings.mqtt_user.help": {
      "sourceHash": "95c922291a9f7fa89f1135d8b5e750a1a32c2c17d26b556012d6c3d939b35bc0",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "此面板使用的凭据。"
    },
    "settings.mqtt_user.label": {
      "sourceHash": "e3b89e9d33f88e523083d8b4436adcc3726c89e97fd3179a2e102d765d1b16ed",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "用户名"
    },
    "settings.navbar_mode.help": {
      "sourceHash": "f795e458995a66ea6439ea9536c23b144a51d9604ebdb7d4a1aee0aab776b551",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "为没有原生导航栏的面板提供屏幕软导航栏。原生模式会将导航交给面板自身的 Android 导航栏，不绘制任何内容。请注意，通过内置渲染器的全屏设置或 Android 仪表盘锁隐藏 Android 系统栏时，原生导航栏仍会被隐藏。"
    },
    "settings.navbar_mode.label": {
      "sourceHash": "2fd20a36857a818323c2b8ff2d46809e566ad5e13f5e7f1ffb9f0750a82cbc83",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "导航栏模式"
    },
    "settings.network_adb.help": {
      "sourceHash": "09613eac91f1ca4d5abdc8ac3c450d38c097a1050bf088881b34ca7b0a17e97e",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "安全风险：让传统 ADB 在 TCP 端口 5555 上持续监听，重启和重新连接后仍然有效。仅在可信网络上主动维护期间启用。如果 ADB 是在 ha-paneld 之外启用的，也必须在那里禁用。"
    },
    "settings.network_adb.label": {
      "sourceHash": "468304e24dd01a9c3ac85163a7ea7bb83e11644a2d5b632c817863337454701b",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "网络 ADB"
    },
    "settings.panel_id.help": {
      "sourceHash": "c32f09aa8a5756c4cfde370f42fc7ce62bb040feb0b9e0375f2932c08988554e",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "用于实体 IDs 和 MQTT 主题的稳定标识符（小写字母、数字和下划线；最多 63 个字符）。"
    },
    "settings.panel_id.label": {
      "sourceHash": "e738d52375d65eb02067cf41e0807c06c4e21f391d5334bb5bed79e9a2e61daf",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "面板 ID"
    },
    "settings.prevent_idle_dim.help": {
      "sourceHash": "e65c72cf163d6535f1c4b8a7bc5edd3731b1f404128861e1889004e1eda20f8d",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "阻止厂商固件在屏幕关闭超时时调暗背光。"
    },
    "settings.prevent_idle_dim.label": {
      "sourceHash": "ab4e8ab5e353c0f7a2772ea83b880bba96a671c022dfc853aee0833b5bd2a62f",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "防止闲置变暗"
    },
    "settings.proximity.help": {
      "sourceHash": "1302fe79949d5f3c6152bd67f6988f2be92ce9a134c49172b2a3c3212d24ab6b",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "根据支持的接近来源学习到的远近占用状态。"
    },
    "settings.proximity.label": {
      "sourceHash": "101194f3e33d01133851120bc7bab9967d2d8988266a7c07ae800f7127e7e3e2",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "接近状态"
    },
    "settings.proximity_level.help": {
      "sourceHash": "b3f0f1e997f952599577ed72fe6a1cdd3b1f9be8ffe6104d131cc52226d1a02e",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "学习到的标准化接近程度，范围为 0 至 100％；二进制来源报告 0 或 100。"
    },
    "settings.proximity_level.label": {
      "sourceHash": "2e718ad3caebfe4bab8ffb0d2946b9fddd9c1e4e10dbc58057102e5ddc61f645",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "接近程度"
    },
    "settings.room_humidity.help": {
      "sourceHash": "7615cfe25fea88ea327f766a4aba84edf4d0eed4c45b5d85cea3ca805b73e0ea",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "来自面板所支持环境传感器的相对湿度。"
    },
    "settings.room_humidity.label": {
      "sourceHash": "b5b23b83711c932f7584f48ce893840e7febe392151c3bdd1e23d2271ee983c5",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "室内湿度"
    },
    "settings.room_temp.help": {
      "sourceHash": "2a8c03beb176b893b0247b5d18d1686427c619d12d605beebf824c1e8fbcb79c",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "来自面板所支持环境传感器的室内空气温度（已应用校准偏移）。"
    },
    "settings.room_temp.label": {
      "sourceHash": "7c417c9119c8cfeb5011b7cba570d356852ae485f9cb5797e10d596141631c6b",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "室内温度"
    },
    "settings.room_temp_offset.help": {
      "sourceHash": "5fe73fe33fc51a45ebf874038937c91f4907eacbfb1f3ba4d0e05f04bce4ff62",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "加到所报告室内温度上的修正值（℃）。面板自身发热通常会导致读数偏高，因此该值一般为负数。此值因面板及安装方式而异，所以批量推送时不会复制。"
    },
    "settings.room_temp_offset.label": {
      "sourceHash": "73c0dc9717cae6ffad518eb11c5dd9d9cd7f6751c3ff2c876065216a57573ea2",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "室内温度偏移"
    },
    "settings.screen.help": {
      "sourceHash": "31433baf205387576ed50ea97527a7fb292903036d7bfc216f994965316dcb9d",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "当前屏幕状态和亮度。Home Assistant 会将灯光原生的 0–255 亮度显示为百分比。"
    },
    "settings.screen.label": {
      "sourceHash": "694cb749771a50b425951ffbdc7b070db7350d4280f98d321ef946b6a7292a68",
      "state": "machine-draft",
      "text": "屏幕亮度"
    },
    "settings.self_update.help": {
